You can throw knives with lightning speed, increasing your attack speed with them by [12%, 19%, 24%, 27%, 31% (TL1-5)] and giving you a [8%, 13%, 16%, 19%, 21% (TL1-5)] chance when striking a target in melee to throw a knife at a random foe within 7 tiles for 100% damage.

This bonus attack can only trigger once per turn, and does not trigger from throwing knife attacks.
